	"FriendlyName": "Tram System - DisplayCluster Bridge",
	"Description": "Bridges TramSystem's synchronized shared observer rig to Epic's nDisplay/DisplayCluster rendering system for production multi-display output. Separate from the core Tram System plugin so a project that doesn't use nDisplay never needs to enable this at all.",
